01:32:06.039 --> 01:32:08.680
As we head towards the final minutes.

01:32:08.680 --> 01:32:10.199
96 on the board.

01:32:14.480 --> 01:32:17.800
Brought down by Sam Whitelock, milestone man.

01:32:18.960 --> 01:32:20.239
Anton Lennart-Brown.

01:32:23.840 --> 01:32:28.039
Scott Barrett, and another big shift from Scott Barrett.

01:32:28.039 --> 01:32:32.239
Roy Goudle spread back out to the right for New Zealand.

01:32:32.239 --> 01:32:34.360
The hands are quick, Mackenzie is quick.

01:32:34.399 --> 01:32:35.639
That's cracked up high.

01:32:36.679 --> 01:32:39.839
Play on, says the referee, nothing is yet.

01:32:39.839 --> 01:32:42.000
Here's Whitelock up over the 22.

01:32:46.399 --> 01:32:48.039
Kane looked to shift it on.

01:32:48.039 --> 01:32:49.359
No, no, eight.

01:32:49.359 --> 01:32:51.759
The ball instead and then they go once more.

01:32:52.639 --> 01:32:55.239
The Whitelock, Mackenzie, the hands are quick.

01:32:55.239 --> 01:32:57.519
Savvier is good too and then the little step

01:32:57.519 --> 01:33:00.000
and Jink a bit of power, the offload for Dane Cole.

01:33:00.000 --> 01:33:02.359
Couldn't quite hold onto it.

01:33:02.359 --> 01:33:03.279
Tackle.

01:33:03.319 --> 01:33:06.639
Just broke down as Dane Cole and Artie Savvier

01:33:06.639 --> 01:33:08.439
combined once more.

01:33:08.439 --> 01:33:11.159
And now Italy from behind their own sticks.

01:33:11.159 --> 01:33:12.559
And got some numbers wide.

01:33:12.559 --> 01:33:16.000
Brex puts it to the toe for Adoglu to chase.

01:33:16.000 --> 01:33:18.359
Mackenzie sweeping across for New Zealand,

01:33:18.359 --> 01:33:20.559
losing control of it.

01:33:20.559 --> 01:33:23.319
Play on here for Italy and one Ignacio Brex.

01:33:24.840 --> 01:33:28.759
And they might get something out of this at the end, Italy.

01:33:28.759 --> 01:33:30.639
As New Zealand scramble back.

01:33:34.279 --> 01:33:36.840
Gavisi just shoves it on from a standing start.

01:33:36.840 --> 01:33:41.639
Favre, Hans-Willi Arnie, always combative, the Jersey 20.

01:33:45.880 --> 01:33:46.719
No, no.

01:33:47.679 --> 01:33:49.039
Cole's trope to get out of it.

01:33:49.039 --> 01:33:51.319
Pass Rello, sizes up the options.

01:33:52.679 --> 01:33:54.759
Now battling away, Italy.

01:33:54.759 --> 01:33:56.359
Reloading each time.

01:33:57.199 --> 01:33:59.039
Flat across the face, the hands are good.

01:33:59.039 --> 01:34:01.920
Adoglu stepping inside to Lea, can't get past him.

01:34:02.159 --> 01:34:05.760
Brilliant from Ioanni and Monti Ioanni for the corner.

01:34:06.640 --> 01:34:10.239
The little hit and spin after the fabulous handling

01:34:10.239 --> 01:34:13.680
and the tries given for Monti Ioanni.

01:34:13.680 --> 01:34:14.960
Well, what a way to finish.

01:34:14.960 --> 01:34:17.199
It's been a disappointing evening.

01:34:17.199 --> 01:34:20.079
But the little continuity, the build up,

01:34:20.079 --> 01:34:22.520
the patience in attack from this Italian side,

01:34:22.520 --> 01:34:23.840
right at the end.

01:34:23.840 --> 01:34:26.039
Excellent and the finish from Monti Ioanni.

01:34:27.079 --> 01:34:29.079
Well under enormous pressure in the tackle,

01:34:29.079 --> 01:34:30.880
he has found a way into that corner.

01:34:32.920 --> 01:34:36.680
Brave as well to play from their own goal line.

01:34:36.680 --> 01:34:37.760
McKenzie couldn't control.

01:34:37.760 --> 01:34:40.279
Brex was on and he's had a good game, Brex actually.

01:34:41.159 --> 01:34:44.680
It's all well tackled by this opposite number.

01:34:46.680 --> 01:34:47.520
Oh.

01:34:50.760 --> 01:34:51.720
Has he grounded it?

01:34:51.720 --> 01:34:53.760
That's gonna be the big question.

01:34:53.760 --> 01:34:57.319
No, the grounding happens before his foot goes into touch.

01:34:57.319 --> 01:35:00.720
The foot is in the air initially as the ball is grounded.

01:35:00.760 --> 01:35:02.039
So we can award the try.

01:35:02.039 --> 01:35:02.880
You can award the try.

01:35:02.880 --> 01:35:03.800
It's a try.

01:35:03.800 --> 01:35:05.720
The ball is grounded while his foot is in the air

01:35:05.720 --> 01:35:07.480
and then his foot goes down, okay?

01:35:10.640 --> 01:35:12.079
Well, the try is given.

01:35:13.840 --> 01:35:14.680
Right on the line.

01:35:14.680 --> 01:35:17.680
Just reward for a courageous final moment.

01:35:17.680 --> 01:35:18.520
Thank you.

01:35:18.520 --> 01:35:19.360
For Ridley.

01:35:26.440 --> 01:35:29.000
Conrad Smith knows a good try when he sees one.

01:35:29.239 --> 01:35:31.600
And he knows the spirit of the game, doesn't he?

01:35:36.199 --> 01:35:37.479
Come on to Ioannis.

01:35:37.479 --> 01:35:38.800
Some really good injections.

01:35:38.800 --> 01:35:40.000
Thank you everyone.

01:35:40.000 --> 01:35:41.640
In the second half.

01:35:41.640 --> 01:35:43.159
Deserves a nice finish as well.

01:35:43.159 --> 01:35:45.920
Paolo Garbisi will have the final act of the match.

01:35:53.600 --> 01:35:55.039
The conversion is wonderful.

01:35:59.159 --> 01:36:03.239
But the All Blacks have put on a show in Lyon

01:36:03.239 --> 01:36:05.520
on a milestone night for Sam Whitelock

01:36:05.520 --> 01:36:08.319
as he becomes the most kept All Black of all time.

